From: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7915: prepare legacy NPU RX state and delivery

Add typed STA, RX BA and BAR synchronization with rollback and physical
band selection. Stop host queues on synchronization failure while keeping
DMA ownership. Validate returned raw RXDs and preserve the host NAPI queue
through delivery and IRQ rearming. Leave checksum validation in software
until the legacy vendor status word is verified.

This does not enable legacy ring takeover. The generic initialization
guard remains until firmware/PPE coexistence and DMA shutdown are resolved.

---
